WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.329
Before you share a record, know which audience

00:00:03.329 --> 00:00:06.307
you are choosing. Visibility is a decision worth

00:00:06.307 --> 00:00:08.541
checking at the point of saving.

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:11.820
Open the record and inspect its visibility. Do

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.700
not assume a default: check the setting on

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.219
the record you are about to use.

00:00:17.619 --> 00:00:20.456
When you want to share, select the correct

00:00:20.456 --> 00:00:23.292
unit and save. Check the unit name as

00:00:23.292 --> 00:00:25.065
carefully as the visibility setting.

00:00:25.465 --> 00:00:28.856
The shared record is now available to the

00:00:28.856 --> 00:00:32.248
authorized leader. Review the access history available in

00:00:32.248 --> 00:00:35.639
your deployment to understand how it was used.

00:00:36.039 --> 00:00:39.108
Choose the audience, confirm the unit, and check

00:00:39.108 --> 00:00:40.259
the saved result.
